{"page":246,"verses":[{"verse_key":"12:87","surah":12,"ayah":87,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰبَنِىَّ ٱذْهَبُوا۟ فَتَحَسَّسُوا۟ مِن يُوسُفَ وَأَخِيهِ وَلَا تَا۟يْـَٔسُوا۟ مِن رَّوْحِ ٱللَّهِ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ لَا يَا۟يْـَٔسُ مِن رَّوْحِ ٱللَّهِ إِلَّا ٱلْقَوْمُ ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"My sons, go and seek news of Joseph and his brother and do not despair of God’s mercy- only disbelievers despair of God’s mercy.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰبَنِىَّ","en_gloss":"O my sons","transliteration":"yābaniyya","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱذْهَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"Go","transliteration":"idh'habū","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَتَحَسَّسُوا۟","en_gloss":"and inquire","transliteration":"fataḥassasū","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"about","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُوسُفَ","en_gloss":"Yusuf","transliteration":"yūsufa","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَخِيهِ","en_gloss":"and his brother","transliteration":"wa-akhīhi","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَا۟يْـَٔسُوا۟","en_gloss":"despair","transliteration":"tāy'asū","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَّوْحِ","en_gloss":"(the) Mercy of Allah","transliteration":"rawḥi","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(the) Mercy of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"none","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَا۟يْـَٔسُ","en_gloss":"despairs","transliteration":"yāy'asu","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":16,"ar":"رَّوْحِ","en_gloss":"(the) Mercy of Allah","transliteration":"rawḥi","verse_key":"12:87"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":